            "heading": "About 20 minutes",
            "text": "<p>Fifteen minutes of chopping and smashing, four minutes of actual cooking. Nothing marinates and nothing has to cool down before you eat it.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "g_serves": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "users",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "Serves 2",
            "text": "<p>One cucumber, one peach, one avocado. A 16 oz bag of shrimp holds four 4 oz portions, so doubling it costs you one more peach.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
