            "icon": "lightning",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "1&ndash;2 minutes a side",
            "text": "<p>Cast iron over medium-high, a slick of oil, and out again the moment the shrimp go bright orange with crisp edges. Overcooked shrimp is the only way to lose here.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
