    "game_plan": {
      "type": "timeline",
      "blocks": {
        "s_shrimp": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sunny-fine-foods-shrimp-salad-ingredients.jpg",
            "subheading": "Minute 0",
            "heading": "Season and sear the shrimp",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Toss the shrimp in a bowl with salt, pepper and a clove of grated garlic. Get a cast iron pan hot over medium-high, add a little oil, then the shrimp in a single layer. One to two minutes a side, until they are bright orange with slightly crisp edges. Out of the pan and onto a plate.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "s_cuke": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sunny-fine-foods-smashed-cucumbers.jpg",
            "subheading": "Minute 5",
            "heading": "Smash the cucumbers",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Lay a Persian cucumber on the board, press down with the flat of a knife until it splits, then tear or cut it into bite-sized pieces. The rough surfaces hold dressing in a way clean slices never do.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "s_fruit": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sunny-fine-foods-cucumbers-and-peaches.jpg",
            "subheading": "Minute 8",
            "heading": "Add the peach, then everything green",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Slice one ripe peach straight into the bowl, then a diced avocado and a generous handful of cilantro &mdash; stems included. Do not toss yet; the avocado will bruise if it sits in dressing while you finish the rest.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "s_finish": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sunny-fine-foods-cucumber-peach-avocado-cilantro.jpg",
            "subheading": "Minute 15",
            "heading": "Dress, toss, finish",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Pile the warm shrimp on top and drizzle the ginger ponzu generously. Toss once, gently, then finish with toasted sesame seeds, a hard squeeze of lime and a big pinch of flaky salt. Eat it immediately, while the shrimp are still warm and the cucumber is still cold.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
